OL,3,AUS and Denmark reach deal over
OL,4,AGreenland after Trump annexation
OL,5,Athreats
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US and Denmark have announced a
OL,8,Fdeal on Greenland's security, resolving
OL,9,Fa diplomatic dispute sparked by
OL,10,FPresident Donald Trump's threats to
OL,11,Fseize it by force.
OL,13,FTrump said the agreement would grant
OL,14,Fthe US "permanent control over
OL,15,Fsecurity, and all other needs" in the
OL,16,Fsemi-autonomous Danish territory.
OL,18,FThe leaders of Denmark and Greenland
OL,19,Fwelcomed the deal to "strengthen
OL,20,Fsecurity" in the region, which they
OL,21,Fsaid was expected to be signed next
OL,22,Fweek, but did not outline its contents.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
