OL,3,AUS and Denmark reach deal over
OL,4,AGreenland after Trump annexation
OL,5,Athreats
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe announcement comes after months of
OL,8,Fthreats by Trump to "take" Greenland
OL,9,Fover national security concerns, citing
OL,10,Fits strategic location for defence
OL,11,Fpurposes and its mineral wealth.
